// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Synboss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P573133279" "Take down Marisa Delany"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P95532853" "You wiped the floor with Marisa Delany, but did not find any evidence that she is the killer!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2226040370" "Marisa Delany was indeed a murderer, but not the one you were looking for."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4063800850" "It's too bad about Marisa, {HeroName}. Well, in terms of the investigation. The PPD were trying to track her all this time; of course, it just took one simple operation from Powers Division to bring her in. I think it's fairly telling. You know, when the PPD were first founded, I expressed concern that they would not be able to match the sheer power that we all had. Sure enough, my concerns were founded.<br><br>Riptide and Aria brought us some possible news. There <i>is</i> a known member of the Resistance here in Imperial right now. She goes by the name of <color yellow>Ricochet</color>. She may be one of the killers, but we can't be sure."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Ricochet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P1604692336" "<color orange>Ricochet coughs hard, trying to regain her composure.</color><br><br>Gotta say... really slapped me with my helmet swapped around... never woulda raised my hand at you bein' a traitor to bombin' the big gold man in the sky, {HeroName}. Why'd you go... and flapjack on us?"
// Answer Text :
"P660217631" "I'm out for myself, Ricochet. You're going to help me move up in the world here."
// Page MovingUp Text :
"P1136435621" "You're one of 'em... go-getter's... shoulda known, shoulda known. You gotta get your brain spinnin' though, {HeroName}. 'Cause if I step outta whatever party they're bringin' me to, I'm gonna make sure you ain't gonna be hob nobbin' it in Imperial with that head of yours. I ain't one to forget when someone pulls a dagger on the cake that we went and baked together."
// Answer Text :
"P1596463059" "Good talking with you Ricochet. Now, take a nap. (Knock Ricochet out)"
// Page KO Text :
"P749320060" "<color orange>You knock out Ricochet. You'll have to hurry to the ambush. Transmuter should have information on what's going on."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P1069245337" "So, big slammer thinks... that {Hero.gender=male he's|she's} gonna make headlines takin' me in... well, go ahead! I ain't aimin' to be slap-jackin'... with you all night long."
// Answer Text :
"P2699739158" "Good. (Knock Ricochet out)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Stern 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P4077444837" "<color orange>You check Stern for any signs of life, but it's too late. Not even his cybernetic implants were able to keep him alive long enough for you to get here."
// Answer Text :
"P2986299254" "(Move forward)"
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P2479271379" "<color orange>Stern groans, barely alive.</color><br><br>{HeroName}... you made it...<br><br>Reese... he disabled... my teleporter... need you... to re-activate... it..."
// Answer Text :
"P987481194" "(Activate Stern's teleporter)"
// Answer Text :
"P3437907197" "(Activate Stern's teleporter and plant a tracking device on him)"
// Page Reactive Text :
"P950248571" "<color orange>You re-activate Stern's teleporter, sending him to safety.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Aria 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P3883164481" "<color orange>You check Aria for any signs of life, but it's too late. Reese made sure she wouldn't survive for long after his assault."
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P548902270" "<color orange>Aria groans, barely alive.</color><br><br>{HeroName}...? Reese... I'll never forgive him... y-you need to... j-jump start my medi-porter..."
// Answer Text :
"P3469462641" "(Activate Aria's teleporter)"
// Answer Text :
"P1884104161" "(Activate Aria's teleporter and plant a tracking device on her)"
// Page Reactive Text :
"P437738097" "<color orange>You re-activate Aria's teleporter, sending her to safety.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Zane 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P3410812407" "<color orange>You check Zane for any signs of life, but it's too late. You can tell that Zane tried to hold off Reese to help the others escape; Reese must have become much more powerful if he could have beaten down Zane so easily."
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P3004562765" "<color orange>Zane gasps for air, barely alive.</color><br><br>{HeroName}... you're a sight... for sore eyes. Reese... you've got to stop him... he's become too powerful... For his own good... s-stop him... F-for me..."
// Answer Text :
"P1207492065" "(Activate Zane's teleporter)"
// Answer Text :
"P3697452127" "(Activate Zane's teleporter and plant a tracking device on him.)"
// Page Reactive Text :
"P1728196730" "<color orange>You re-activate Zane's teleporter, sending him to safety.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Warrant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P2019881981" "<color orange>It looks like Reese spared no expense to make sure that Warrant suffered more than anyone else here. You see a note from Reese pinned to Warrant...<br><br><color yellow>{HeroName}-<br><br>Come get me, if you can. I'll be waiting to finish what we started back in that warehouse.<br><br>-Reese.</color>"
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P3134754660" "<color orange>It looks like Reese spared no expense to make sure that Warrant suffered more than anyone else here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CalvinScott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P3354567635" "{HeroName}, what's wrong with you?! I just got the word that <i>Ricochet</i> was captured by <i>you</i>. Do you care to explain that to me? Why you did that?"
// Answer Text :
"P1309457819" "You don't think it would've been odd, if I let her go? People might get suspicious."
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P1307073644" "{HeroName}, good to speak with you. I heard you were close to capturing Ricochet. It's good that you let her go; she was on important business for us within the underground of Imperial City. Losing her at this point would've been a huge blow to our operations.<br><br>You're working on the issue with the Powers Division killer, right? What is the progress on that?"
// Answer Text :
"P69341455" "I'm going to confront Reese right now. My team is probably still alive."
// Page StillAlive Text :
"P3262036234" "Hrm... Reese, you said? The name is familiar, one of the former Top Dogs in the Powers Division. He's someone that we'll need out of the way, when the time comes.<br><br>If you run into those Powers Division 'friends' of yours, place tracking devices on them. It'll help us to know where more Powers Division are, especially if any of them begin working on anything that's more in depth with Emperor Cole."
// Answer Text :
"P1881143145" "I'll see what I can do."
// Answer Text :
"P630352336" "Eddie Polstra, I found that information on him. That he's not from this dimension."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1055534819" "Perhaps. Alright... we'll work on getting her out of the BAF. Now, on your end. I heard you're tracking down the man murdering the Powers Division?"
// Answer Text :
"P746294465" "I am. And, if I guess correctly, the team I was working with is most likely dead."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P3622322508" "Hrm... Because you went after Ricochet? I see, I see. Well, that was a good plan, {HeroName}. I don't think I have much to suggest to you, other than finishing off the murderer. You've already done a good enough job today of possibly finishing off those members of the Powers Division.<br><br>All I would say is that if they're not dead, plant a tracking device on them. We'll monitor their movements from down here to know where they are - at all times."
// Answer Text :
"P4177638146" "Understood. I'll see what I can do."
// Page Eddie Text :
"P3925152512" "Not from this <i>dimension</i>? Interesting...<br><br>He spoke of a dimension full of chaos and destruction, you say? I have a strong feeling that he's been brainwashed, or perhaps he's just simply a biased fool. We have an ally who is from that very dimension, a man by the name of <color yellow>Dark Watcher</color>. He is here to support us in our fight against Tyrant. He has provided us with various schematics to improve our weapons. Unfortunately, Dark Watcher cannot help us too much, or Tyrant will know that we are receiving help from somewhere else. Which will be <i>very</i> dangerous. I already suspect that Tyrant is aware of Eddie's dimension...<br><br>I have a request, {HeroName}. If you've found any information regarding what Tyrant knows about Eddie's dimension, bring it to me when we speak again."
// Answer Text :
"P515170056" "I'll do that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - TransmuterDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2279785647" "<color deepskyblue>Letting Go</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: The Past Revisited</color><br><br>{HeroName}! Thank goodness you're here. It's your team, they've been ambushed! I was only able to get some information out from Zane before his communicator went down. The man who attacked them - it's <color yellow>Reese</color>!"
// Answer Text :
"P1500103351" "Reese? Who's Reese?"
// Answer Text :
"P3066281795" "So, it looks like Reese isn't dead. I'll have to change that."
// Page ReeseExplain Text :
"P203690013" "<color deepskyblue>Letting Go</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: The Past Revisited</color><br><br>Reese was one of the former top dogs, back in Nova Praetoria. The man who <i>robbed</i> me of my powers. Justice was served when an up and coming Powers Division member took him down and even tried to <i>blow him up</i>. Unfortunately, it looks like it didn't stick. It all makes sense now, {HeroName}.<br><br>He sees you as the new 'top dog' and wants to reclaim his former position! You need to get to that lab before he gets away!<br><br><color Paragon>Members of the Resistance working undercover for Calvin Scott should inform him of what is happening.</color>."
// Answer Text :
"P2925241926" "I'm on it. (Start Mission)"
// Answer Text :
"P3075141561" "Give me a moment."
// Page ReeseNoExplain Text :
"P2632686833" "<color deepskyblue>Letting Go</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: The Past Revisited</color><br><br>It would appear that way. {HeroName}, you need to finish this, once and for all. He won't stop until he reclaims all his power, which means killing <i>you</i>!"
// Answer Text :
"P2836267066" "I'll finish what I started back in Nova. (Start Mission)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2273649302" "It's likely that this woman Ricochet is the one responsible for the murders. However, as you and I have experienced, it's <i>also</i> possible this is a red herring. If I may advise, the best course of action would be to split up.<br><br> We know that Ricochet is somewhere in the tunnels with another Resistance member by the name of Twitcher. We're also aware that there has been some odd activity by the Resistance in a lab nearby. Lastly, there's some rumors of an underwater cavern somewhere in Imperial. Given that your power easily matches most of your team, it seems that it would be best for you to investigate Ricochet. Riptide is the only other member with the abilities to investigate the underwater cavern. Warrant, Aria, Stern, and Zane will stay in the lab and monitor the situation.<br><br>Ah... this brings me back, {HeroName}. I remember an operation that myself, Praetor White, and Praetor Sinclair were involved in. The three of us split up to track down some of the early members of the Resistance. The thrill of the chase, the adrenaline pumping... I tell you, there's nothing like it!"
// AcceptString :
"P1486509843" "Right. Do you have the location of the tunnels, or...?"
// SendOffString :
"P2198952474" "Ah, I go on, of course. Here's the location. <color orange>You'll have to take down Twitcher first in order to get Ricochet's exact location.</color><br><br>Warrant will be in touch with you regarding their status within the labs. If anything happens, he or I will let you know. This could be big, {HeroName}, Ricochet is a known member of the Resistance. She's responsible for the deaths of dozens of PPD; some say she even planted nerve gas in a lab in Nova Praetoria. Bringing her down will put your name out there for everyone to see - if they haven't seen it already, that is."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3630579514" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Fame or Honor</color>"

