"P1942783530" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Warrant, reporting in. Zane, Aria, Stern and I have breached the labs and are proceeding with the clean up.<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Riptide is still looking for any clues of an underwater cavern, I'll let you know if he comes up with anything."
// SaysList :
"P2128803708" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>We've... got a... problem. {HeroName}! We walked into an a-a-ambush!<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>I'm hurt... real bad. Don't know where... the others are. Need you to... get us help... as... soon as... possible... it's... it's... Reese...!"

