// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SaysList :
"P2913728643" "And so the final dog arrives. Surprised to see me still standing, {HeroName}?"
// SaysList :
"P212919008" "You're the final dog that needs to die today, {HeroName}."
// SaysList :
"P2412312240" "No one can kill me, {HeroName}. Not when I haven't reached my true power. Not YOU! Not PRAETOR WHITE! NO ONE!"
// SaysList :
"P2029792712" "I've come too far to let some dog like you take me down!"
// SaysList :
"P1533186931" "I don't need anyone's help to kill you this time, {HeroName}. You won't stand in my way to true power. Not now, not EVER AGAIN!"
// SaysList :
"P709193639" "Anyone who stands in my way will get torn down. Powers Division will be MINE!"
// SaysList :
"P4226624081" "Not even death can stop me, {HeroName}. Don't you understand?! I'm destined for greatness, unlike you!"
// SaysList :
"P2948576109" "I won't be put down again! Your place is to follow MY orders, MY power, MY DESTINY!"
// SaysList :
"P21201439" "N-no... why... why did it have to end like... this?<em> She told me...<em> that I would finally...<em> have my...<em> revenge..."
// SaysList :
"P2944906052" "No... it wasn't supposed to be... like this...<em>She said... no one could stop me... now..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Reese 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1522002339" "Make Reese Pay"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4213138168" "Reese is once again put down. Hopefully this will be the final time you ever have to deal with him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1418430699" "So, it's done, {HeroName}? Reese is dead? I hope this is for the last time. I wish I could have been there, I really do. Ever since he robbed me of my powers, my life has been a...<br><br>No, you don't need to hear that. It doesn't matter how things are now, right? I still have my past, my glory days. That's what keeps me going, just like how your current exploits keep you going. Reese, however, could not find that spirit of contentment that you and I have. I do wonder, however, <i>who</i> exactly brought him back from the brink of certain death. This matter warrants further investigation...<br><br>Praetor White has made the suggestion that you and the remaining Powers Division go on to your own individual investigations, particularly because of a woman who wishes to speak with you. Her name is Tami Baker. I can put you in touch with her, if you'd like."
// RandomFameString :
"P2811326622" "I'm bought that t-shirt with {HeroName} on it after {Hero.gender=male he|she} stopped that murderer!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
